{"id":"n41324-1-7","stage":2,"title":"낯설다 · 陌生","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41324-1-7-1","ko":"둘이 서로 낯선 사이이니?","zh":"你们俩是彼此不认识的人对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"둘이","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘이","audio":"/audio/2ef3d078f170aff7e805.mp3"}},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}},{"text":"낯선","meaning":"陌生，面生","explanation":"낯설다：陌生，面生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"낯설다","audio":"/audio/f8ed723eebf05294a03f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41324","senseId":"1","lemma":"낯설다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낯선","audio":"/audio/ad08c431a35300062622.mp3"}},{"text":"사이이니?","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이이니","audio":"/audio/130e79e2618aca28a501.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3","entryId":"34869","definition":"一加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["둘ː"]},{"id":"fbeb53408bcf7039","term":"서로","zh":"互相，相互","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3","entryId":"66374","definition":"两个以上缔结关系的对象相对于各自的对方。","pronunciation":["서로"]},{"id":"f8ed723eebf05294","term":"낯설다","zh":"陌生，面生","audio":"/audio/f8ed723eebf05294a03f.mp3","entryId":"41324","definition":"以前未曾看见过或见过面，所以彼此不认识。","pronunciation":["낟썰다"]}